@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### List seeded plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans

### Reindex plans (explicit, config-first trigger)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/indexing/reindex/plans

### AI plan recommendation (returns scores + hydrated plans)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans/ai/search?q=team%20collaboration%20api%20access%20analytics&limit=3

### App-level plan search endpoint (returns only plans)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans/search?query=priority%20support%20large%20organization&limit=3

### Debug: show which AI/indexing beans are active
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/debug/indexing/components

### Debug: mutate + index + search end-to-end
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/debug/indexing/demo?mode=sync

### Guest login (returns numeric userId + UUID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/guest/login

### Account resolver policies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-resolver/policies

### Account resolver scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-resolver/scenarios

### Seed deterministic account resolver personas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account-resolver/demo/seed

### Inspect ready account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-resolver/users/91/readiness

### Inspect missing payment blocker
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-resolver/users/92/readiness

### Inspect missing address blocker
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account-resolver/users/93/readiness

### Natural language orchestration (position-aware: resolver)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "92",
  "sessionId": "subhub-session-1",
  "conversationId": "chat-subhub-1",
  "position": "resolver",
  "query": "Why can't I place an order? If payment is missing, add my Visa ending 4242."
}

### Execute inspect readiness read action manually
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/query/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "inspect_account_readiness",
  "userId": "92",
  "confirmed": true,
  "params": {}
}

### Confirm and execute payment-method resolution manually
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/query/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "update_payment_method",
  "userId": "92",
  "confirmed": true,
  "params": {
    "type": "CARD",
    "provider": "Visa",
    "last4": "4242"
  }
}

### Natural language refund/account-credit scenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "94",
  "sessionId": "subhub-session-2",
  "conversationId": "chat-subhub-2",
  "position": "resolver",
  "query": "I was charged after a support incident. Please give me a $25 account credit."
}
